        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "SSS.",
          "worked": "$AB=CD$ and $BC=DA$ (marked equal). $AC=CA$ (common side). Therefore $\\triangle ABC\\equiv\\triangle CDA$ by SSS.",
